{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01423","headline":"相和歌辞 贾客乐 · 张籍","name":"相和歌辞 贾客乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金陵向西贾客多，船中生长乐风波。\n欲发移船近江口，船头祭神各浇酒。\n停杯共说远行期，入蜀经蛮远别离。\n金多衆中爲上客，夜夜算缗眠独迟。\n秋江初月猩猩语，孤帆夜发满湘渚。\n水工持檝防暗滩，直过山边及前侣。\n年年逐利西复东，姓名不在县籍中。\n农夫税多长辛苦，弃业长爲贩卖翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}